     "unit": 2,
     "q": "A $2.0$ kg cart on a frictionless horizontal table is connected by a light string over a frictionless pulley to a hanging $3.0$ kg mass. What is the tension in the string? Use $g = 10\\ \\text{m/s}^2$.",
