     "answer": 0,
     "explain": "The Truman Doctrine asked Congress for $400 million in aid to Greece and Turkey to resist communist pressure. It put George Kennan's containment strategy into practice and led to the Marshall Plan, NATO, and later the Korean and Vietnam wars.",
